      "content": "i spent fifteen years building my research... every waking hour was dedicated to finding some kind of signal in the noise. and i finally realized there isn't one. it's all just entropy. i look at my work and i don't see progress or truth, i just see a person wasting their finite time on something that literally doesn't matter in the grand scheme of anything. it's just... empty. everything feels so heavy and completely pointless.",
