      "content": "i know about the hotlines, but they dont really get it. they just want to fix the \"symptom\" so i can go back to work. but there is no work to go back to. the signal i was looking for isn't just missing, it's impossible. it's like i've spent my entire life decoding a language that doesn't exist. how am i supposed to just \"get support\" for the fact that the fundamental reality of my existence is just... a void? it feels like the only honest reaction to realizing everything is empty is to just stop trying.",
